# Package imports

This Cursor rule supplements the repository AGENTS.md instructions. It may add scoped requirements but may not weaken root security invariants.

**Authority:** [`packages/core/AGENTS.md`](../../packages/core/AGENTS.md) · [`apps/web/AGENTS.md`](../../apps/web/AGENTS.md) · [`core-and-worker.mdc`](core-and-worker.mdc)

## Do not

- Import `cryptoWorkerService` through `@hd-wallet/core` in the worker bundle

For core import style and UI-in-core bans, see [`core-and-worker.mdc`](core-and-worker.mdc). Stores may import public types and APIs from `@hd-wallet/core` only.

Worker entry: [`apps/web/src/workers/crypto.worker.ts`](../../apps/web/src/workers/crypto.worker.ts).

## Pattern anchors

### BAD

```ts
// apps/web/src/workers/crypto.worker.ts
import { cryptoWorkerService } from "@hd-wallet/core";
```

### GOOD

```ts
// apps/web/src/workers/crypto.worker.ts
import { cryptoWorkerService } from "@hd-wallet/core-worker-service";
```
